/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-ACCOUNTABILITY-WHY-NOT-SOONER-2026-09-10.md:5:A sequence of **pre-registered gates**, each of which genuinely failed, and each of which the contract's own rules then used to prohibit advancing: the physics gate whose eleven-against-zero-zero pooled efficiency came out at −0.049 % with two of eight worlds positive, ending that successor route under §7; the fast kill screen that returned no support and barred the next two stages; and earlier three-head, context and reference-gate failures.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-ACCOUNTABILITY-WHY-NOT-SOONER-2026-09-10.md:22:**I spent the day measuring §C4** — the deadline comparator, prefix removal, reparametrisation, load regime, beam width. Five routes, all of them §C4.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md:23:Under the sealed rule iterated set-level moves do eventually exceed the prefix's pooled value, but at roughly twenty times the evaluation cost while still losing on most anchors. The honest reading, which the report states itself, is that the prefix is a **much cheaper route to broadly high quality**, not that the catalogue-only asymptote is necessarily lower.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md:26:Together with two other measurements today, every route for making the coordination layer's contribution look larger is now closed:
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md:28:- **the deadline route** — a competent anytime unilateral already holds 82 % to 88 % of its converged gain at the 30.08-second interval;
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md:29:- **the prefix-removal route** — this measurement;
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md:30:- **the reparametrisation route** — direct prediction ranks better but removes the three-route structure the owner's requirement is stated over.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md:35:There is no remaining exploratory direction on the coordination side. What has never been measured at scale is the owner's actual requirement — the source-training contrast over the three routes — whose arms are compared with each other and are therefore untouched by all of the above. That is where the remaining effort belongs.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-DECISION-BEAMWIDTH-NO-CHANGE-2026-09-10.md:36:Corrected-physics coordination span, three panels: **+0.899 %** on eight anchors, **+1.291 %** on twenty, **+0.717 %** on thirty dates with the old pairing. Small, positive, and stably present. Four exploratory routes were measured and none enlarges it; the fifth shows the design point needs no change.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-STRATEGIC-ENERGY-IS-IN-THE-CONTROL-LAW-2026-09-10.md:10:| everything the association layer can contend for — coordination, joint search, all three learned routes | **about +1 %** |
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-STRATEGIC-ENERGY-IS-IN-THE-CONTROL-LAW-2026-09-10.md:25:The three-route structure survives a change of decision object. Pointed at the control law rather than the association, the roles map directly: the surplus of changing a beam's power and mode setting; whether that setting persists; and the interaction between beams' settings. **The interaction is stronger there**, because power settings couple directly through interference rather than indirectly through shared airtime, so the third route would have more to predict, not less.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-OPEN-DECISION-EVAL-DATE-POOL-2026-09-09.md:21:373 daily files, 2025-07-27 to 2026-08-20, of which **166 are TRAIN**. Seventeen calendar dates inside that span are missing from the archive: 2025-08-02, 08-07, 08-22, 09-17, 10-18, 10-25, 11-09, 2026-01-12, 02-25, 03-04, 03-14, 03-15, 06-17, 06-21, 06-30, 07-25, 08-04. Any spread of dates must route around those gaps.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-ERRATUM-14-CONFLATION-2026-09-10.md:9:Our three components are neither. They are prediction heads whose outputs feed a fixed ranking rule. The only thing that maps to the source is the **ablation style**: the contract's intervention is neutral-source substitution of one route's training data, with all heads retained, updated and deployed — which is a training-time intervention in the source's manner.
